    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "With its motto \u201cNurturing Excellence,\u201d its academic staff of about 500 directed by Dr. G.P. Prabhukumar, and its affiliation with Visvesvaraya Technological University, the Acharya Institute of Technology, located at Soldevanahalli, Acharya Dr. Sarvapalli Radhakrishnan Road, Hessarghatta Main Road, Bangalore \u2013 560090, was designated a Technical Campus by the All India Council for Technical Education of Mumbai."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The Acharya Institute of Technology's motto is \"Nurturing Excellence\". Acharya was given the 'Technical Campus' status by All India Council for Technical Education (located in Mumbai), and is affiliated with the Visvesvaraya Technological University. The academic staff at Acharya is made up of around 500 employees, Dr. G. P. Prabhukumar is the director. The Acharya Institute of Technology is located at Soldevanahalli, Acharya Doctor Sarvapalli Radhakrishnan Rd, Hessarghatta Main Road, Bangalore - 560090."
        }
    },
